<catalogue name="Codex - Imperial Guard" id="82fc-8ad4-7b4b-dd4a" authorName="Boff" battleScribeVersion="2.03" gameSystemId="9ea8-c89d-9104-ed03" gameSystemRevision="24" library="false" revision="19" type="catalogue" xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema">
  <readme>I haven&apos;t put restrictions for the Regimental style to build a list, such as 1 Command HQ, 3 Guard/Heavy Weapons teams, 3 additional unit. Doing so would be rather messy and complicated with all the possible choices, and frankly isn&apos;t really a huge deal.

Please see Imperial Guard Codex Pg. 79 to ensure you are adding the correct units.</readme>
  <categoryEntries>
    <categoryEntry name="Additional Unit (May have 1 additional unit for every 1 Regimental Unit)" id="070f-0182-955b-1543" hidden="false">
