      <rules>
        <rule name="Turret Firing Arcs" id="6dbc-397d-7a62-fd0e" hidden="false">
          <description>The lascannon and Battlecannon must be fired within the same 45° arc. Firing the first weapon sets the arc for the remainder.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Baneblade Crew" id="6fe7-2db8-5e12-692e" hidden="false">
          <description>The Baneblade has 9 Imperial Guard (standard statline) and 1 Tank Commander. All have flak armour and a laspistol.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Tank Commander" id="a878-b237-27ca-7911" hidden="false">
          <description>Tank Commander can direct the weapons to fire at a single target, which gives +1 to hit that target only.
If the gunner is killed, the tank commander takes over the main weapon using his own BS but may no longer give +1 to hit bonus to a target even for his own weapon</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Movement Rules" id="7cf8-502d-d822-6435" hidden="false">
          <description>Can move over low walls, hedges, rubble and trenches without penalty - knocking down walls and hedges and collapsing trenches in a 6&quot; wide path</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
